OL,3,GNEWSANesbitt's departure proves
OL,4,Apolitics can't be removed from health
OL,5,
OL,6,FMike Nesbitt's sudden and somewhat
OL,7,Fdramatic departure as health minister
OL,8,Fshould come as no surprise.
OL,10,FThe move came on Tuesday, amid a a
OL,11,Fclash over withdrawing emergency
OL,12,Fgeneral surgery services from Causeway
OL,13,FHospital, with the UUP leader Jon
OL,14,FBurrows.
OL,16,FIn March he told Stormont's health
OL,17,Fcommittee that if he ever felt that his
OL,18,Fparty was trying to influence how he
OL,19,Fdid his role he'd rather "walk or
OL,20,Fresign rather than become some sort of
OL,21,Flap dog or functionary for a political
OL,22,Fparty".
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
